{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32673","headline":"和友人忆洞庭旧居 · 刘沧","name":"和友人忆洞庭旧居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"客舍经时益苦吟，洞庭犹忆在前林。\n青山残月有归梦，碧落片云生远心。\n谿路烟开江月出，草堂门掩海涛深。\n因君话旧起愁思，隔水数声何处砧。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘沧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32673.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32673","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}